<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Vasp 1996 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Vasp 1996 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian airline company Vasp issued the following statement on its 1996 results for its holding firm.</p>
<p>			   1996			 1995</p>
<p>    shr profit	   0.0059 reais	     0.0057 reais</p>
<p>    net profit	   157.4 mln		  151.1 mln</p>
<p>    net operating revs 1.2 bln		    993.4 mln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
